Hi Avery,

Here's what's new in Vanta this month.

Continuous SOC 2 monitoring, expanded
We added 34 new automated tests covering AWS, GitHub, and Google Workspace, including MFA enforcement on every org member and branch-protection checks on default branches. Your dashboard will show new findings within 24 hours.

ISO 27001 crosswalk
If you're SOC 2 compliant, you can now see exactly which ISO 27001:2022 controls you already satisfy and what's left. Most SOC 2 customers start at 70%+ coverage.

Vendor risk management
Track every vendor's security posture, collect questionnaires, and get alerts when a vendor's status changes. Included on Growth and above.

Trust Center refresh
A new layout, custom domains, and a "request access" flow that logs who asked for your report.

